2:["$","p",null,{"children":"We design and coordinate your itinerary and act as an intermediary between you and the local suppliers involved — hotels, driver-guides, and activity operators — each of whom operates under their own terms and conditions. We take care in choosing who we work with, but we're not liable for the direct acts or omissions of an independent supplier, or for events beyond our reasonable control (see below)."}]
3:["$","h2",null,{"children":"9. Force majeure"}]
4:["$","p",null,{"children":"Neither party is liable for a failure to perform caused by events beyond reasonable control, including natural disasters, extreme weather, civil unrest, government action, or public health emergencies. Where this affects your trip, we'll work with you in good faith on rescheduling or an appropriate resolution."}]
5:["$","h2",null,{"children":"10. Complaints"}]
6:["$","p",null,{"children":"If something isn't right during your trip, please tell your driver-guide or contact us directly as soon as possible so we can try to resolve it while you're still travelling. After your trip, written complaints should be sent within 28 days of your return."}]
7:["$","h2",null,{"children":"11. Governing law"}]
8:["$","p",null,{"children":"These terms are governed by the laws of Sri Lanka."}]
9:["$","h2",null,{"children":"Contact us"}]
a:["$","p",null,{"children":["Questions about these terms or an existing booking can be sent to"," ",[["$","span","info@finelankatours.com",{"children":[["$","a",null,{"href":"mailto:info@finelankatours.com","children":"info@finelankatours.com"}]," or "]}],["$","span","travel@finelankatours.com",{"children":[["$","a",null,{"href":"mailto:travel@finelankatours.com","children":"travel@finelankatours.com"}],""]}]],", or by phone at ","+94 70 193 2526 / +94 77 745 1085","."]}]
